WEBVTT

00:26:57.750 --> 00:27:00.322
AG: She sold it in 2015 to LinkedIn,

00:27:00.346 --> 00:27:04.741
for, oh, 1.5 billion dollars.

00:27:05.117 --> 00:27:07.068
Lynda.com was one of the first companies

00:27:07.092 --> 00:27:09.203
to offer professional learning online.

00:27:09.227 --> 00:27:11.545
Maybe you've heard
of their courses in animation,

00:27:11.569 --> 00:27:12.822
design and software.

00:27:12.846 --> 00:27:16.002
Maybe you've even taken classes there
that advanced your career.

00:27:16.549 --> 00:27:19.124
Many founders who are trying
to grow a unicorn company,

00:27:19.148 --> 00:27:21.306
think they need
to generate one brilliant idea

00:27:21.330 --> 00:27:22.981
and scale it rapidly.

00:27:23.005 --> 00:27:25.267
They think they need to be sprinters,

00:27:25.291 --> 00:27:28.564
but Lynda approached her career
more like a marathoner.

00:27:28.588 --> 00:27:32.487
Her online learning company didn't look
anything like a success early on.